  "problem": "Native baseline commits a new source, then failed follow-up getLocalState closes its dialog while leaving the source list empty. Shared DJ save/delete uses the same void-return/readback pattern.",
  "decision": "Mechanical extension of the already-reviewed PR118 canonical snapshot contract. Root owns all edits and review; no new design alternative or independent paired review claimed.",
  "changes": [
    "saveDjs and saveNewsSources return their exact normalized committed LocalStateSnapshot via existing serialized updateLocalStateAndGet.",
    "Sources save/delete, DJEditor save/duplicate and DJs delete all consume the receipt with existing confirmLocalState before refresh and normal dismissal.",
    "Existing normalization, affected-profile markers, cleanup, playback invalidation, duplicate guards, validation/failure draft handling and dismissal rules remain. No extra write or provider action."
  ],
